    1139   00:45AD  CD 4C 4C                call    PRINTHL
    1140   00:45B0  DD E5                   push    ix
    1141   00:45B2  E1                      pop hl                          ; IX in HL
    1142   00:45B3                      WIFI_LIST_LOOP:
