    1222   00:4631  FE 20                   cp  #20                         ; Spacebar?
    1223   00:4633  CA 47 46                jp  z,WIFI_SELECT_SPACEBAR      ; Check if re-scan or next page
    1224   00:4636  FE 0D                   cp  CR                          ; ENTER?
