    2194   00:4C52  23                      inc hl
    2195   00:4C53  C3 4C 4C                jp  PRINTHL
    2196   00:4C56                      
    2197   00:4C56                      ; Routine to print the string addressed by HL on a line, if exceeding it, ends with ..
