    5504   00:5B36                          ; next two bytes are response size bytes (UB count two bytes, always 0, and data read), save it -2 to BC
    5505   00:5B36                      TCPIP_TCP_RCV_ST2A:
    5506   00:5B36                          CHECK_DATA
